<div class="page">
  <div class="two-column-layout">
    <div class="column">
      <h2 class="section-heading">Charlie Creighton</h2>
      <div class="contact-info">
        <p>Email: <span data-field="contact.email">{{ contact.email }}</span></p>
        <p>Phone: <span data-field="contact.phone">{{ contact.phone }}</span></p>
        <p>Location: <span data-field="contact.location">{{ contact.location }}</span></p>
      </div>

      <h3 class="section-heading">EDUCATION</h3>
      <div class="education-entry">
        <p><span data-field="education.institution_name">{{ education.institution_name }}</span> - <span data-field="education.location">{{ education.location }}</span></p>
        <p><span data-field="education.degree">{{ education.degree }}</span> in <span data-field="education.major">{{ education.major }}</span></p>
        <p><span data-field="education.dates">{{ education.dates }}</span></p>
      </div>
      <div class="education-entry">
        <p><span data-field="education.institution_name_2">{{ education.institution_name_2 }}</span> - <span data-field="education.location_2">{{ education.location_2 }}</span></p>
        <p><span data-field="education.degree_2">{{ education.degree_2 }}</span> in <span data-field="education.major_2">{{ education.major_2 }}</span></p>
        <p><span data-field="education.dates_2">{{ education.dates_2 }}</span></p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="column">
      <div class="helpful-tip">
        <p>While style does not need to change with every iteration of your document, this example reflects a need for more space. For example, to condense the heading to one line, location and LinkedIn were edited.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="helpful-tip">
        <p>Here, "Relevant" has been added to the experience title. This change can help readers understand your expertise in a specific area.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h3 class="section-heading">RELEVANT EXPERIENCE</h3>
  {% for job in relevant_experience %}
    <div class="job-entry">
      <p><span data-field="job.company_name">{{ job.company_name }}</span>, <span data-field="job.location">{{ job.location }}</span></p>
      <p><span data-field="job.job_title">{{ job.job_title }}</span> <span data-field="job.dates">{{ job.dates }}</span></p>
      <ul>
        {% for bullet in job.responsibilities %}
          <li>{{ bullet }}</li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ul>
    </div>
  {% endfor %}

  <h3 class="section-heading">ADDITIONAL EXPERIENCE</h3>
  {% for job in additional_experience %}
    <div class="job-entry">
      <p><span data-field="job.company_name">{{ job.company_name }}</span>, <span data-field="job.location">{{ job.location }}</span></p>
      <p><span data-field="job.job_title">{{ job.job_title }}</span> <span data-field="job.dates">{{ job.dates }}</span></p>
      <ul>
        {% for bullet in job.responsibilities %}
          <li>{{ bullet }}</li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ul>
    </div>
  {% endfor %}
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div class="two-column-layout">
    <div class="column">
      <h3 class="section-heading">SKILLS</h3>
      {% for skill in skills %}
        <span data-field="skills[{{ loop.index0 }}]">{{ skill }}</span>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    <div class="column">
      <div class="helpful-tip">
        <p>Bullet points have been further expanded with more detail and focus on skills rather than duties, with more bullet points written for most/recent relevant experiences.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div class="two-column-layout">
    <div class="column">
      <h3 class="section-heading">Graduate School Example: Ex-Research-based Psychology</h3>
      <div class="education-entry">
        <p><span data-field="education.institution_name_grad">{{ education.institution_name_grad }}</span> - <span data-field="education.location_grad">{{ education.location_grad }}</span></p>
        <p><span data-field="education.degree_grad">{{ education.degree_grad }}</span> in <span data-field="education.major_grad">{{ education.major_grad }}</span></p>
        <p><span data-field="education.dates_grad">{{ education.dates_grad }}</span></p>
      </div>
      <div class="education-entry">
        <p><span data-field="education.institution_name_grad_2">{{ education.institution_name_grad_2 }}</span> - <span data-field="education.location_grad_2">{{ education.location_grad_2 }}</span></p>
        <p><span data-field="education.degree_grad_2">{{ education.degree_grad_2 }}</span> in <span data-field="education.major_grad_2">{{ education.major_grad_2 }}</span></p>
        <p><span data-field="education.dates_grad_2">{{ education.dates_grad_2 }}</span></p>
      </div>
